SUMMARY:Fleetwood Macked: The Ultimate Tribute To Fleetwood Mac
DESCRIPTION:Friday October 9th\, 2026\nDoors | 7:00 PM\nShow | 8:00 PM \nReserved Balcony & Mezzanine Seating | $34.70 + Fees\nReserved Riser Seating | $45.40 + Fees\nReserved Orchestra Seating | $55.95 + Fees \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n—————————————————\nPresented by Big Fan Presents\n—————————————————\nFleetwood Macked – The Ultimate Tribute to Fleetwood Mac is a New York based Fleetwood Mac Tribute Band. Hailed as the most authentic Fleetwood Mac tribute band in the U.S.\, much of the realism comes from the bands history. 18 years ago the band set out to provide audiences with the truest live Fleetwood Mac experience possible.  \nHusband and wife musical team Hillary and Michael (Stevie and Lindsey ) and friends Tracy\, Jay\, Phil and Andrew (Christine\, John and Mick)\, have made great music together in various incarnations\, finally all came together with their mutual love of Fleetwood Mac. All the members of Fleetwood Macked are and have always been professional\, touring rock musicians\, which also adds to the authenticity of the sound of the band.  \nFleetwood Macked live brings the passion\, depth\, heart and the musicianship Fleetwood Mac’s music requires. Out of love and respect\, musical liberties are not taken\, songs are recreated just as Fleetwood Mac intended them. Whether performing the Rumours album in it’s entirety or a decades show featuring Fleetwood Mac’s hits from the 70’s\, 80’s\, 90’s and today\, every performance transports audiences to another time and place. Complete with costume changes\, & dialogue it is a show not to be missed. \nCheck out Fleetwood Macked – The Ultimate Tribute to Fleetwood Mac here!\nWebsite | Instagram | Facebook\n—————————————————\n*Ticket Alert*  \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers.  Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets.  Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/fleetwood-macked-the-ultimate-tribute-to-fleetwood-mac/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2026/07/Untitled-July-28-2026-at-11.02.12-e1785277092955.jpeg
END:VEVENT
