SUMMARY:Pearl Jam & Nirvana Tribute Night: The Ledbetters and Live & Unplugged
DESCRIPTION:Saturday October 10th\, 2026\nDoors | 7:00 PM\nShow | 8:00 PM \nGeneral Admission Standing Room | $32.65 + Fees\nReserved Balcony & Mezzanine Seating | $32.65 + Fees \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n————————————————–\nPresented by Mickey’s Black Box\n————————————————–\nThe Ledbetters deliver the ultimate Pearl Jam tribute experience\, combining faithful recreations of their legendary studio recordings with the raw energy and passion of unforgettable live performances. The band brings Pearl Jam’s deep catalog to life with authenticity\, precision\, and intensity. From arena-shaking anthems to fan-favorite deep cuts\, The Ledbetters transport audiences back to the height of flannel-wearing days to celebrate the music that defined a generation. If you love Pearl Jam\, this is as close as it gets to the real thing. They’ll make you feel ALIVE. \nCheck out The Ledbetters here!\nWebsite | Instagram | Facebook \nSupported by: Live & Unplugged \nLive & Unplugged faithfully recreates the iconic atmosphere of Nirvana’s legendary MTV Unplugged performance. This full-band acoustic tribute captures the emotion\, intimacy\, and timeless songs that helped define the Seattle sound.\n————————————————–\n*Ticket Alert* \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers. Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets. Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/pearl-jam-nirvana-tribute-night-the-ledbetters-and-live-unplugged/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2026/06/The-Ledbetters-10.10.26-2-e1781904966452.jpeg
END:VEVENT
