SUMMARY:Captain Crash: Celebrating the Music of Bon Jovi
DESCRIPTION:Saturday October 17th\, 2026\nDoors | 6:00 PM\nShow | 7:00 PM \nGeneral Admission Standing Room | $31.60 + Fees \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n————————————————–\nPresented by Mickey’s Black Box\n————————————————–\nCaptain Crash returns to Mickey’s Black Box for another full night of Bon Jovi done right. \nFrom the first note to the last chorus\, this is about bringing you back to what made those songs stick in the first place. The big singalongs. The deep cuts that deserve their moment. The kind of night where the crowd becomes part of the show. \nIf you were with us last time\, you already know what this room feels like when it’s packed and loud. If you missed it\, this is your shot to be in the middle of it. \nCaptain Crash brings the thrill\, energy\, and authentic live concert experience of Bon Jovi straight to you. From the electrifying anthems like “Livin’ on a Prayer” and “Wanted Dead or Alive” to the heartfelt ballads that define a generation\, our shows are packed with the sound and spirit that made Bon Jovi legendary. \nCaptain Crash prides themselves on delivering the electrifying magic of a live Bon Jovi concert. From the soaring vocals that echo through the crowd to the roaring guitars that set your heart racing\, our performances are designed to immerse you in the thrill of an arena-sized rock show. Every note\, every chord\, and every moment is dedicated to creating a concert experience you’ll never forget. No wigs. No gimmicks. Just the sound\, the energy\, and the songs exactly the way they’re meant to hit live! \nCheck out Captain Crash here!\nWebsite | Instagram | Facebook \nSupported by: Lovelace & Duct Tape\n————————————————–\n*Ticket Alert* \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers. Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets. Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/captain-crash-celebrating-the-music-of-bon-jovi/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2026/08/MBB-Website-2.jpg
END:VEVENT
