SUMMARY:Concerts for Cancer at MBB: Ft. The Jess Zimmerman Band & Friends
DESCRIPTION:Saturday October 24th\, 2026\nDoors | 6:00 PM\nShow | 7:00 PM \nReserved Mezzanine Seating | $59.05 + Fees\nReserved Balcony Seating | $69.30 + Fees\nReserved Orchestra & Riser Seating | $84.95 + Fees \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID Required to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n—————————————————\nPresented by The Thrive for Life Foundation\n—————————————————\nJoin us for the THRIVE LIVE Concert Series | Concerts for Cancer – a night where music meets meaning. \nOn October 24th\, 2026\, experience an unforgettable evening at Mickey’s Black Box featuring incredible live performances by the Jess Zimmerman Band\, Ruthie Collins (Solo)\, and Cody Tyler (Solo). \nDiscover one of the most unique music venues in Lititz\, PA – Mickey’s Black Box\, as THRIVE LIVE continues its exciting concert season. Each concert is more than just a show – it’s a chance to connect\, to feel\, and to make a difference. \nLet music feed your soul – and be part of something that truly matters. \nTHRIVE proudly supports the life-changing work of the Penn State Cancer Institute and the Kristen Olewine Milke CARE Center\, which is dedicated to providing compassionate\, whole-person care for adults diagnosed with cancer and their families. \nWhen you attend a THRIVE LIVE concert\, you’re doing more than enjoying great music – you’re helping bring comfort\, care\, and hope to those who need it most. \nWe believe in the power of music to inspire. \nNow\, it’s helping to heal. \nJoin us. Because you matter. And because of you – we THRIVE.\n—————————————————\n*Ticket Alert*  \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers.  Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets.  Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/concerts-for-cancer-at-mbb-ft-the-jess-zimmerman-band-friends/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2026/04/JZB2026b-e1776546959485.png
END:VEVENT
